-- Session 26: a FREE model -- x may take any value in 0..25 at every step, in any order -- so a
-- formula that holds here holds on EVERY run over that range. 01_llm_ltl.py checks
-- LTLSPEC (llm <-> reference) here: true means the two formulas say the same thing.
MODULE main
  VAR
    x : 0..25;
